body:
@jezdez As a user, I think this should be reverted as well. 

Our team started running black on our builds and now we need a C compiler on even native-python packages. We use black primarily as a minimal sanity test in a testing/cicd setting so I ask the maintainers to please consider reducing system configuration overhead.

Alternatively you could have regex as an `extras_require` and do something along the lines of

```python
try:
    import regex as re
except ImportError:
    import re
```

Best of both worlds?
